<title>POLAND: AGROS OCT GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 4.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS OCT GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 4.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Group Net profit	     4.23 vs    3.52</p>
<p> Group Pre-tax profit	 8.27 vs    5.54</p>
<p> Group Operating profit    37.18 vs    6.62</p>
<p> Group Sales		  140.22 vs  110.03</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
